# A synchronous extension-only catalogue/option-read probe proves status follows story policy
# without publishing an option epoch or candidate; original catalogue and reputation are restored.
# Recruitment extension: reversible synthetic reputation controls and unplaced native body
# samples validate six coherent factions, both selection routes and deterministic names.
# An initial 6000-turn hostile wait must retain debt/water and advance downstream road work.
# The real first guest then stays frozen across a further 6000 turns with hostile reputation.
# No physical admission/home allocation or cold-load claim.
# Synthetic founding and one dedicated store; every arrival step after that is the real cadence on
# real turns. The camp keeps no roof on purpose, so the ordinary want behind the guest line is real.
# Not ordinary play, not a rendered Charter, and no cold-load claim.
DESCRIPTION=the first guest's correspondence opens once and stands ahead of the camp's ordinary want
REQUEST=founding-first-city
START=8.22@40,12
SCRIPT=stagedigest;first-guest-setup;advance 6000;first-guest-check;advance 6000;first-guest-check;advance 6000;first-guest-check;stagedigest
VERBS=first-guest-setup,first-guest-check
EXPECT=stagedigest:OK~founded=false,first-guest-setup:OK~native-first-guest phase=0,advance:OK,first-guest-check:OK~native-first-guest phase=1,advance:OK,first-guest-check:OK~native-first-guest phase=2,advance:OK,first-guest-check:OK~native-first-guest cases=1 passed=1 failed=0,stagedigest:OK~founded=true,COMPLETE
SET=growth,native-regression
TIMEOUT=1200
